<ul>
<li>It connects to the GitHub REST or <button type=3D"button" class=3D"curs=
or-pointer rounded-sm bg-yellow-100 px-0.5 font-normal text-inherit underli=
ne decoration-yellow-500 decoration-dotted underline-offset-3 hover:bg-yell=
ow-200">GraphQL API</button> using your client token.</li>
<li>It iterates through the repository tree recursively.</li>
<li>It filters files based on your directory and extension rules before dow=
nloading their full text, saving network bandwidth and API quota.</li>
<li>It converts each matching file into a <code>Document</code> object and =
injects file metadata (such as <code>file_path</code> and <code>file_name</=
code>) directly into <code>metadata</code>.</li>
</ul>
