t-child]:mb-0">
<p>Many remote readers load all matching records into memory at once. If yo=
u run <code>load_data()</code> on a Notion database or a Slack workspace wi=
th 100,000 pages, Python will attempt to hold all document strings in RAM. =
For large datasets, fetch data in smaller batches by filtering by date, fol=
der, or channel.</p>
</div></aside>
