lternative method: <code>lazy_load_data()</code>.</p>
<p>Instead of returning a full list of documents, <code>lazy_load_data()</c=
ode> returns a Python generator. It fetches one item over the API, yields t=
he <code>Document</code>, and pauses until your code asks for the next item=
:</p>
